hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1474","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni zirah Banu Zafar ke ek aadmi Abu Shahm Yahudi ke paas girwi rakhi."
"1475","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni zirah Abu Shahm Yahudi ke paas girwi rakhi."
"1476","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni zirah Abu Shahm Yahudi ke paas girwi rakhi."
"1477","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Girwi rakhi hui cheez girwi rakhne wale se nahin roki jaegi, us ka nafa usi ke liye hai aur us ka nuqsan bhi usi par hai.' Shafi'i ne farmaya: Us ka nafa us ki zyadati hai, aur us ka nuqsan us ka halak hona aur us mein kami hai."
"1478","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi ki misl ya is ke hum-ma'na riwayat hai jo is ki mukhalifat nahin karti."
"1479","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Girwi rakhi hui cheez us ke malik se jo use girwi rakhe nahin roki jaegi, us ka nafa usi ke liye hai aur us ka nuqsan bhi usi par hai.'"
"1480","[AI-translation] Aur mujhe ahl ilm mein se ek se zyada afrad ne khabar di, Yahya bin Abi Unaisah se, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn Musayyab se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Ibn Abi Zi'b ki hadees ki misl."
"1481","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ke do bete Abdullah aur Ubaidullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) lashkar ke sath Iraq ki taraf nikle. Jab donon wapas mude to yeh donon Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke ek aamil ke paas se guzre, to us ne in donon ko khush aamdeed kaha aur woh Basrah ka ameer tha. Us ne kaha: Agar mujhe tumhare liye kisi mamle ka ikhtiyar hota jis se tumhen nafa pahuncha sakta to zaroor karta. Phir us ne kaha: Han! Yahan Allah Ta'ala ke maal mein se maal hai jise main Ameerul Momineen ki taraf bhejna chahta hun, main woh tumhen bator qarz deta hun, tum donon is se Iraq ka saman khareed kar Madinah mein bech dena, phir asal maal Ameerul Momineen ko de dena aur nafa tumhara ho jaega. In donon ne kaha: Hamen manzoor hai, aap maal hamen de den. Phir ameer Basrah ne in ko Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke naam khat likh kar diya ke in se maal wasool kar len. Jab woh donon Madinah aae to unhon ne maal bech kar nafa hasil kiya. Phir jab asal maal Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko diya to unhon ne donon se poocha: Kya us ne sare lashkar walon ko isi tarah qarz diya hai jis tarah tum donon ko diya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. To Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Ameerul Momineen ke do beton ko hi qarz diya! Tum asal maal aur us se hasil shuda nafa donon ada kar do. Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) to yeh sun kar khamosh rahe albatta Ubaidullah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Aey Ameerul Momineen! Yeh Aap ke liye jaiz nahin hai, kyunke agar maal tabah ho jata ya is mein nuqsan hota to ham is ke zamin the. Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne phir farmaya: Is ko ada kar do. Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) to khamosh rahe albatta Ubaidullah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne dobara baat dohrai. Phir Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas baithe logon mein se ek aadmi ne kaha: Aey Ameerul Momineen! Agar Aap ise qiraz ki soorat de den to behtar hai. Phir Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne asal maal aur aadha nafa le liya aur is maal ka aadha nafa Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) aur Ubaidullah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne liya."
"1482","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Ja'far ne koi cheez khareedi to Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Main Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas jaunga aur tere khilaf tasarruf na karne ka muqadma darj karunga.' Jab Abdullah bin Ja'far (Raziyallahu anhu) ne yeh baat Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) ko batai to unhon ne farmaya: 'Main teri is bai' mein tera shareek hun.' Phir woh Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae aur Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Is ko tasarruf se rok den.' To Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Main is ka hissedar hun.' To Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: 'Main aise aadmi ko tasarruf se kaise rok sakta hun jis ka hissedar Zubair (Raziyallahu anhu) ho.'"
"1483","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo koi aadmi muflis ho gaya, phir aadmi ne apna maal ba'ainihi muflis ke paas pa liya to woh is ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"1484","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) farmate hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs apna maal ba'ainihi muflis aadmi ke paas pa le to woh is ka doosron ki nisbat zyada haqdar hai.'"
"1485","[AI-translation] Madinah ke qazi Abu Khaldah Zurqi ne bayan kiya ke ham Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas ek muflis aadmi ko le kar aae to unhon ne farmaya: Isi ke mutalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo koi aadmi faut ho gaya ya muflis ho gaya to saman ka malik jab apne maal ko ba'ainihi usi haalat mein pae to woh is ka zyada haqdar hai.'"
"1486","[AI-translation] Zaid Maula Mumba'is se, Zaid bin Khalid Juhani se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur us ne luqta ke mutalliq sawal kiya to Aap ne farmaya: 'Is ki thaili aur bandhan ki khoob janch padtal karo, phir ek saal tak is ka elan kar do, agar is arsa mein is ka malik aajae to use de do warna woh cheez tumhari hai.'"
"1487","[AI-translation] Mu'awiyah bin Ubaidullah bin Badr ne bayan kiya ke us ke walid ne use khabar di ke us ne Sham ke raston par safar kiya to unhon ne raste mein ek thaili pai jis mein assi deenar the, phir Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se is ka zikr kiya to Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Masjid ke darwazon par is ka elan karo, aur ek saal tak jo bhi Sham se aae use batao aur jab saal guzar jae to woh thaili tumhari hai."
"1488","[AI-translation] Nafi' (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne raste se giri padi koi cheez utha li phir woh Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main ne luqta pai hai, ab kya karun? To Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Is ka elan karo. Us ne kaha: Main ne kiya. Ibn Umar ne kaha: Mazeed karo. Us ne kaha: Main ne bahut kiya. Phir Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne farmaya: Main tumhen aisi cheez ke khane ka hukm nahin deta, agar tum chahte to use na pakadte."
